# NAME: Google AI & Agent Ecosystem (Gemini, Antigravity, DeepMind)
# DESCRIPTION: 专门针对 Google AI 产品线的独立分流规则（含 Gemini Web/App/API、Google Antigravity Agent/IDE、AI Studio、DeepMind 等）
# NOTE: 请在代理工具配置文件中将此规则置于通用 Google 规则之上


# DOMAIN
# Google Gemini Web & App Endpoints
DOMAIN,gemini.google.com
DOMAIN,bard.google.com

# Google Antigravity (Agentic Platform, IDE & Background Agent Service)
DOMAIN,antigravity.google.com

# Google AI Studio & MakerSuite Backend Endpoints
DOMAIN,aistudio.google.com
DOMAIN,makersuite.google.com
DOMAIN,alkalicore-pa.clients6.google.com
DOMAIN,alkalimakersuite-pa.clients6.google.com
DOMAIN,alkalipairing-pa.clients6.google.com
DOMAIN,webchannel-alkalimakersuite-pa.clients6.google.com

# Generative Language APIs & Gateway
DOMAIN,generativelanguage.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,content-generativelanguage.googleapis.com

# Google Proactive & Assistant AI Services
DOMAIN,proactivebackend-pa.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,robinfrontend-pa.googleapis.com

# Workspace AI & Labs Endpoints
DOMAIN,waap.google.com
DOMAIN,waap-pa.clients6.google.com
DOMAIN,notebooklm.google.com
DOMAIN,labs.google.com
DOMAIN,jules.google.com

